-- =============================================================================
-- StoryNest - complete database (schema + all data)
-- =============================================================================
-- A full export of the finished database: 86 titles with their page text, the
-- tags, the staff and demo accounts, and the reviews, reading progress,
-- reactions and favourites behind them.
--
-- Import it on any machine with:
--
--     mysql -u root -p < database/storynest-full.sql
--
-- It DROPS and recreates the `storynest` database, so do not run it against a
-- copy you have your own work in.
--
-- This file and `npm run db:setup` produce the same data, so either route can
-- be used. Everything dated in here is measured from a fixed reference point
-- rather than from the day it is built, so an import matches the original
-- exactly instead of drifting with the calendar.
--
-- Accounts and passwords are listed in ACCOUNTS.md.
-- =============================================================================

